		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Alluring shapeshifter who appears as a woman, a giant spider, or a hybrid. Seduces men, wraps them in webs, and implants black eggs in their stomachs.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 12, <strong>HP</strong> 34, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 bite +5 (1d4 + poison), <strong>MV</strong> near (climb), <strong>S</strong> +3, <strong>D</strong> +2, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> +1, <strong>W</strong> +2, <strong>Ch</strong> +4, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 7</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Poison</strong>. CON 12+ or 1d6 WIS damage. Coma at 0 WIS.</p><p></p><p><strong>Shapechange</strong>. Assume the form of a woman.</p><p></p><p><strong>Spider Whisperer</strong>. Speak with spiders. CHA 12+ or spiders must obey commands for 1d4 rounds.</p><p></p><p><strong>Web</strong>. One target stuck in place. DEX 12+ on turn to escape.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
